config MT6628
	tristate "MediaTek MT6628 SDIO bring-up"
	depends on MMC
	select CRC32
	select FW_LOADER
	help
	  Initialize the WLAN firmware on MediaTek MT6628 SDIO devices.
	  This driver is under development and does not yet provide a
	  wireless network interface.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here. The module
	  will be called mt6628.
